<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-008" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:petition" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:petition:m0000" ref="39o_b6y_n74">王大將軍</persName>與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:petition:m0005" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元皇</persName>表云：「<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:petition:m0011" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">舒</persName>風概簡正，允作雅人，自多於<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:petition:m0025" ref="i4e_4wq_2qc">邃</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:biography" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:biography:m0000" ref="i4e_4wq_2qc">邃</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:biography:m0002" ref="i4e_4wq_2qc">處重</persName>，琅邪人，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:biography:m0009" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">舒</persName>弟也。意局剛清，以政事稱。累遷中領軍、尚書左僕射。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:note" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:note:m0000" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">舒</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:note:m0002" ref="i4e_4wq_2qc">邃</persName>並<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin098-wang-family:note:m0004" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>從弟。</p>
</text>
